WEBVTT

00:11.011 --> 00:13.556
[rock music playing]

00:45.713 --> 00:47.590
CHAPTER 32:
A VARIABLE CALLED NA DEUL-I

00:47.673 --> 00:49.842
-Everything going well?
-Mm-hmm.

00:49.925 --> 00:51.510
[gentle pop music playing on speaker]

00:51.594 --> 00:53.387
It's nice to see you're doing well too.

00:54.013 --> 00:55.389
[chuckles]

00:57.349 --> 01:00.352
Honestly I was a little surprised
to hear from you,

01:00.436 --> 01:01.437
but glad too.

01:02.855 --> 01:05.733
Really, then
why didn't you reach out to me first?

01:06.901 --> 01:08.194
[chuckles]

01:10.613 --> 01:11.697
Are you okay now?

01:12.281 --> 01:13.449
Mmm.

01:13.532 --> 01:16.368
I was so worried
when I heard about your surgery.

01:16.452 --> 01:17.745
I couldn't contact you.

01:20.289 --> 01:21.791
I'm sorry I didn't tell you.

01:22.625 --> 01:24.376
I was just as shocked myself.

01:25.252 --> 01:26.378
And I was frustrated.

01:28.088 --> 01:29.882
So, you decided to become a teacher?

01:29.965 --> 01:31.425
That was unexpected.

01:31.509 --> 01:33.844
I thought you'd obviously continue
with the research.

01:33.928 --> 01:36.096
[no audible dialogue]

01:36.180 --> 01:38.182
[slow, gentle music playing]

01:41.477 --> 01:43.229
[both chuckling]

01:43.312 --> 01:45.397
-What is it?
-What?

01:51.612 --> 01:53.948
[both chuckle]

01:56.700 --> 01:57.952
[E-den] Eui-ju?

01:58.452 --> 01:59.453
What are you doing here?

01:59.537 --> 02:00.871
EPISODE 10

02:01.747 --> 02:02.748
Mr. Ha.

02:02.832 --> 02:06.919
[stuttering] I just came here to study,
[chuckles] But I'm going to go home now.

02:07.002 --> 02:08.295
Eui-ju.

02:08.379 --> 02:10.840
You finally decided to start studying?

02:10.923 --> 02:13.133
[laughs]

02:14.969 --> 02:17.638
[chuckling] And how come you're here?

02:18.264 --> 02:20.182
-Is that Mr. Ga?
-[Eui-ju whispering] No, wait.

02:20.266 --> 02:22.184
Look who's here!

02:22.268 --> 02:25.187
The cold- blooded robot,
Mr. Ga, is having coffee with someone,

02:25.271 --> 02:26.730
and a lady at that!

02:26.814 --> 02:28.774
[stammers] Hold on.

02:29.483 --> 02:30.484
Are you…

02:32.027 --> 02:34.405
Professor Na Deul-i? Is that right?

02:35.322 --> 02:36.615
Uh…

02:36.699 --> 02:39.201
-Yes.
-[gasps, laughs]

02:39.285 --> 02:40.953
Oh, my! I knew it! I saw you on the news.

02:41.036 --> 02:44.456
I was really impressed by your interview
about winning the Fields Medal.

02:44.540 --> 02:46.333
[Deul-i] Oh, thank you so much.

02:46.417 --> 02:48.586
Oops, I'm sorry, my bad.

02:48.669 --> 02:50.588
Hello. I'm Mr. Ga's colleague at school.

02:50.671 --> 02:53.591
My name is Ha E-den.
It's so very nice to meet you.

02:54.300 --> 02:55.342
I see.

02:56.302 --> 02:57.428
Oh.

02:57.511 --> 02:58.637
[chuckles]

02:59.513 --> 03:03.976
Anyway, I was just wondering, what exactly
is your relationship with Mr. Ga Woo-su?

03:05.686 --> 03:07.813
-We're friends.
-Oh, yeah?

03:07.897 --> 03:09.857
So you're just friends? I see.

03:09.940 --> 03:11.942
But you're alone together
at this coffee shop.

03:12.026 --> 03:14.403
That seems like a date to me. [chuckles]

03:15.821 --> 03:16.822
Should we go?

03:16.906 --> 03:18.198
-[chuckles]
-Let's go.

03:18.282 --> 03:22.036
[sighs] The two of you make
such a lovely couple.

03:22.119 --> 03:24.079
Like a match made in heaven.

03:24.163 --> 03:25.164
See you soon.

03:25.247 --> 03:26.457
-[stutters] Goodbye.
-Goodbye.

03:27.499 --> 03:28.834
Keep studying, all right?

03:28.918 --> 03:31.003
If you want to become someone
like Professor Na Deul-i.

03:31.962 --> 03:33.005
Take care now.

03:36.842 --> 03:38.010
-[Woo-su] Allow me.
-[door opens]

03:38.093 --> 03:40.095
[Deul-i] Oh. Okay. Thank you.

03:40.179 --> 03:41.180
Hello there.

03:42.598 --> 03:44.350
Uh… My name is Yeo Eui-ju,

03:44.433 --> 03:47.144
and Mr. Ga Woo-su is actually
my homeroom teacher at school.

03:47.978 --> 03:50.356
Oh. Hello there.

03:51.065 --> 03:54.693
Whoa. It's such a surprise to see that
you have a student of your own.

03:54.777 --> 03:55.945
[chuckles]

03:56.028 --> 03:59.406
Are you his friend
from when you were in college?

03:59.490 --> 04:01.450
Oh, no.
We've been friends since middle school.

04:02.242 --> 04:04.078
Ah… Middle school.

04:05.162 --> 04:06.163
That's a long time.

04:06.246 --> 04:07.414
You can go now.

04:08.415 --> 04:09.667
Remember what I offered.

04:10.501 --> 04:11.585
You'll consider it?

04:13.087 --> 04:14.254
I'm not sure.

04:14.922 --> 04:17.341
Oh. Are you playing hard to get?

04:17.424 --> 04:19.259
[chuckles] Just get going now.

04:19.343 --> 04:20.427
All right.

04:20.511 --> 04:22.638
Oh. I'll see you again
another time, Eui-ju.

04:23.472 --> 04:25.224
Yes. Goodbye now.

04:25.975 --> 04:27.017
Bye.

04:39.405 --> 04:40.990
-Mr. Ga, your friend…
-[sighs]

04:41.615 --> 04:43.951
…she seems like a really wonderful person.

04:44.034 --> 04:46.620
She's beautiful
and she seems really kind too.

04:47.287 --> 04:49.665
And to have even won a Fields Medal.

04:49.748 --> 04:51.458
Wow. That's seriously amazing, really.

04:51.542 --> 04:52.876
I wish I had a friend like that.

04:54.503 --> 04:56.672
I bet she's incredibly popular too.

04:56.755 --> 04:58.257
She probably has a boyfriend.

04:58.924 --> 05:03.137
[sighs] But also, it could be tiring
to be around someone that perfect.

05:03.220 --> 05:04.972
You know,
when someone's good at everything,

05:05.055 --> 05:07.182
the people around them tend
to get compared.

05:08.559 --> 05:10.394
It can make them feel small for no reason.

05:13.022 --> 05:14.023
So what's your point?

05:15.607 --> 05:17.735
I mean, I was just wondering

05:17.818 --> 05:21.447
what kind of boyfriend
someone that gorgeous might have.

05:22.072 --> 05:23.323
Why are you wondering?

05:25.826 --> 05:28.495
If you don't get over a 50
on the upcoming math exam,

05:28.579 --> 05:32.082
I'll tell your parents about your novel
during the parent-teacher meeting.

05:34.084 --> 05:35.085
Huh?

05:35.753 --> 05:37.212
Hey, no, that's unfair!

05:37.296 --> 05:40.049
Mr. Ga, you don't mean it, do you?

05:40.132 --> 05:41.383
Do you? You shouldn't…

05:42.509 --> 05:44.636
Come on, Mr. Ga.

05:45.304 --> 05:48.515
I'll try my best.
But I may not be able to get a 50.

05:50.434 --> 05:54.229
Mr. Ga, about what your friend
was talking about earlier…

05:54.313 --> 05:56.940
[clears throat]
What did she ask you to consider?

05:57.733 --> 05:59.276
It's none of your business.

05:59.943 --> 06:02.071
Would it kill him
to say it a little nicer?

06:02.154 --> 06:03.238
[phone buzzes]

06:03.781 --> 06:04.782
Remember my soda.

06:05.616 --> 06:06.825
Mr. Ga, wait a second.

06:07.451 --> 06:09.036
H-Hold on, wait there.

06:09.912 --> 06:11.538
Oh, no. Don't go, don't go, don't go.

06:11.622 --> 06:13.207
Uh… Just wait right there.

06:13.290 --> 06:14.291
I'll be right back.

06:14.374 --> 06:16.001
-[whimsical music playing]
-Hey, hey.

06:23.425 --> 06:25.010
I'm all done. [chuckles]

06:27.429 --> 06:29.807
Drinking soda is a common cause
of constipation.

06:30.682 --> 06:32.976
Hope you won't have to go to the ER again.

06:33.060 --> 06:35.979
I didn't buy it for me.
I had to buy it for my younger brother.

06:36.772 --> 06:38.107
What a sister.

06:38.190 --> 06:41.443
[chuckles] He just uses me
because he has dirt on me.

06:41.527 --> 06:43.153
-[sniffs]
-What does he have on you?

06:44.446 --> 06:48.242
You see. [sighs] It's just that
I only got caught by two people.

06:50.244 --> 06:53.831
That day,
I was lost in my writing again as usual.

06:55.624 --> 06:57.876
And I was also chatting online.

06:57.960 --> 06:59.378
[whimsical music playing]

07:01.630 --> 07:02.965
[online friend 1] I was just wondering

07:03.048 --> 07:05.175
under what name
you've all saved this group chat.

07:05.259 --> 07:07.094
[online friend 2] Beautiful Life. BL.

07:07.177 --> 07:09.221
[online friend 3] How about
a real estate group chat?

07:09.304 --> 07:11.014
Since my husband
checks my phone sometimes.

07:12.391 --> 07:14.893
[Eui-ju] This is a draft
of what I'm working on these days.

07:14.977 --> 07:18.730
It's about a young master and his servant.
I'd appreciate your feedback on this.

07:21.108 --> 07:23.193
[online friend 1]
I love the relationship setting.

07:23.861 --> 07:26.530
[online friend 2] I wonder why
your novels don't get many views.

07:26.613 --> 07:28.240
I feel frustrated myself.

07:28.866 --> 07:32.244
[Eui-ju] A sweet young master bawling
because of a feisty servant.

07:32.327 --> 07:34.746
[sighs] Just thinking about it
is thrilling.

07:35.831 --> 07:37.332
[door creaks]

07:39.710 --> 07:40.752
[music stops]

07:44.047 --> 07:45.048
[Eui-ju] I think

07:45.924 --> 07:46.925
there's someone

07:47.551 --> 07:49.511
behind me right now.

07:50.596 --> 07:51.722
Could it be a ghost?

07:52.472 --> 07:54.308
[online friend 1]
You'll be happy if it's a ghost.

07:54.391 --> 07:56.268
If it's your parents,
my heart goes out to you.

07:56.351 --> 07:58.437
[tense music playing]

08:05.944 --> 08:07.112
[exhales heavily]

08:11.450 --> 08:13.827
-[tapping keys]
-[owl hooting]

08:16.663 --> 08:18.207
[thunder rumbles]

08:18.290 --> 08:19.333
[thunderclap]

08:23.045 --> 08:24.213
Did you see it?

08:27.341 --> 08:30.886
Well, at least,
I'm glad it wasn't my mom or my dad.

08:30.969 --> 08:34.306
But I do have to keep buying him soda
whenever he wants me to.

08:35.015 --> 08:36.725
-[sighs]
-Why do you like it so much?

08:37.601 --> 08:39.102
I don't know.

08:39.186 --> 08:40.771
I just like it. That's all.

08:42.856 --> 08:44.900
That's probably why
you're still going at it.

08:46.068 --> 08:48.779
Well, somehow I still feel like
I'll make it big one day.

08:52.074 --> 08:53.492
So you have baseless confidence.

08:53.575 --> 08:57.454
If your confidence has a basis,
that's not confidence, it's a prediction.

08:57.537 --> 09:00.540
[gasps] That means
I'm going to keep moving forward.

09:00.624 --> 09:01.875
And I'll keep getting better.

09:05.754 --> 09:06.964
Mr. Ga.

09:07.047 --> 09:11.969
Remember, when EBC came
to film the TV show,

09:12.052 --> 09:15.222
and you stopped
right in the middle of telling your story?

09:15.305 --> 09:16.348
[clears throat]

09:16.431 --> 09:19.559
I still want to know why
you decided to become a teacher.

09:34.199 --> 09:36.201
[people talking on television]

09:37.244 --> 09:38.287
So did you have a good time?

09:39.162 --> 09:40.163
Yeah.

09:41.873 --> 09:43.292
[groans]

09:44.126 --> 09:47.754
She came back to Korea after years
of glory for having won a Fields Medal.

09:47.838 --> 09:50.757
But she came all the way to Jeonju
just to see you?

09:50.841 --> 09:52.134
Huh? Why?

09:52.217 --> 09:54.511
And it wasn't like
she wanted to see the whole Olympiad crew.

09:54.594 --> 09:55.595
It was just you.

09:55.679 --> 09:56.888
Only you.

09:56.972 --> 09:58.265
Why only you?

09:59.099 --> 10:02.728
I guess beautiful memories sprouted
from a fragment of your summer-like youth.

10:03.312 --> 10:05.230
-[Gi-jeon] Did they go out together?
-[Da-ju] Mmm!

10:05.314 --> 10:07.190
There really is
no other explanation for it.

10:07.274 --> 10:10.402
For things to be like that,
there has to be chemistry

10:10.485 --> 10:11.653
between a man and a woman.

10:11.737 --> 10:14.114
That spark is
what makes you remember someone

10:14.197 --> 10:16.325
for years
and makes you want to see them again.

10:16.408 --> 10:17.951
-Comprendes, amigo?
-[Gi-jeon] Right.

10:18.035 --> 10:19.119
It's none of your business.

10:21.747 --> 10:23.749
-Guess it's true.
-[door closes]

10:23.832 --> 10:26.668
That bastard wasn't just studying
after all. [clicks tongue]

10:27.711 --> 10:32.049
The way I see it, that girl Na Deul-i and
Woo-su met at the Olympiad,

10:32.132 --> 10:34.801
dated, and then they just broke up.

10:34.885 --> 10:36.678
-No way.
-Mm-hmm.

10:36.762 --> 10:39.097
That's why he dropped out
in the middle of it all. Why?

10:39.181 --> 10:41.433
Just to go see his ex-girlfriend again,

10:42.142 --> 10:43.143
his heart…

10:43.226 --> 10:44.936
-Mm-mmm…
-His heart.

10:45.020 --> 10:48.315
He felt too restless and uneasy.
That's why he couldn't keep going.

10:49.149 --> 10:53.236
The cold-blooded Ga Woo-su had
a flicker of love.

10:53.320 --> 10:55.364
-[sighs] Dang.
-You know what I'm saying?

10:55.447 --> 10:57.866
-Yeah, that's my boy. [clicks tongue]
-Come on. That can't be the reason.

10:58.742 --> 10:59.743
It sure can be.

11:00.577 --> 11:02.329
Why? Because they were rivals.

11:03.121 --> 11:04.122
Woo-su must've gone, like…

11:07.042 --> 11:08.251
"I'll give up here.

11:08.960 --> 11:10.754
You can go higher or whatever if you want.

11:11.505 --> 11:12.506
Only one of us can win."

11:12.589 --> 11:16.551
So you're saying Woo-su gave up
on math over a girl he liked? No way.

11:18.178 --> 11:19.179
Actually,

11:19.930 --> 11:20.931
there's another reason.

11:22.140 --> 11:23.225
What is it?

11:25.977 --> 11:26.978
You know,

11:27.562 --> 11:28.563
his camera phobia.

11:29.981 --> 11:31.066
He gave up in case he won.

11:31.149 --> 11:32.526
-Mmm…
-Ah…

11:33.151 --> 11:34.152
[scoffs]

11:37.406 --> 11:39.408
[imitates Deul-i] "Wow.
It's such a surprise

11:39.491 --> 11:41.243
to see that
you have a student of your own.

11:41.785 --> 11:42.994
[scoffs]

11:43.078 --> 11:45.205
[normal voice]
Why is it such a surprise? Huh?

11:45.288 --> 11:47.416
Is it that surprising for a teacher
to have a student?

11:48.750 --> 11:50.502
I'll see you again another time, Eui-ju.

11:51.962 --> 11:52.963
"Another time"?

11:53.797 --> 11:54.798
[scoffs]

11:55.298 --> 11:56.299
That's right.

11:57.676 --> 11:59.302
We may meet again sometime.

12:01.888 --> 12:02.889
[clears throat]

12:02.973 --> 12:04.975
-[whimsical music playing]
-[sighs]

12:09.104 --> 12:10.814
[dramatic sting plays]

12:14.025 --> 12:17.362
WE WERE FRIENDS, EPISODE 7

12:17.446 --> 12:19.739
[Dong-ju coughing]

12:19.823 --> 12:21.825
[suspenseful music playing]

12:23.076 --> 12:25.078
[rope grinding, creaking]

12:32.377 --> 12:33.795
Who are you?

12:38.550 --> 12:39.551
Me?

12:40.135 --> 12:41.845
The Chair's secretary, Na Ran-i.

12:42.345 --> 12:46.433
As long as I'm getting paid, I'll do
anything, even dirty work like this.

12:46.516 --> 12:47.684
[sinister music playing]

12:47.767 --> 12:49.811
I was ordered to get you away
from Ju Si-on.

12:50.979 --> 12:52.898
Your face is too handsome to be wasted.

12:52.981 --> 12:54.191
[chuckles]

12:54.274 --> 12:55.567
But I need you gone.

12:56.234 --> 12:58.403
-Don't do it! Don't!
-[grunts]

12:58.904 --> 13:00.322
-[grunts]
-[groans]

13:02.699 --> 13:03.825
[door bangs]

13:03.909 --> 13:05.827
[western music playing]

13:05.911 --> 13:07.829
Choi Yoon!

13:07.913 --> 13:09.831
[gasps] How did you find us?

13:09.915 --> 13:11.500
[breathes heavily, grunts]

13:16.338 --> 13:17.672
[grunts]

13:20.217 --> 13:21.968
-[Deul-i grunts]
-[grunts]

13:22.052 --> 13:25.472
[grunting]

13:32.562 --> 13:33.688
[yells]

13:34.898 --> 13:36.816
-[grunts]
-[Woo-su grunts]

13:36.900 --> 13:38.151
[groans]

13:38.235 --> 13:39.319
[pants]

13:40.445 --> 13:42.531
-[Deul-i grunts]
-Choi Yoon!

13:50.288 --> 13:51.289
Are you okay?

13:54.584 --> 13:55.835
Yes, I'm okay.

13:58.964 --> 14:01.174
SI-ON LOWERED HIMSELF
TO MEET YOON'S EYES

14:01.758 --> 14:02.842
Let's go.

14:05.554 --> 14:09.015
SO CLOSE AND SO INTENSE,
HIS GAZE MADE YOON'S HEART RACE

14:14.479 --> 14:16.231
JUST THEN, RAN-I CALLED OUT

14:16.314 --> 14:17.399
[Deul-i] This is amusing.

14:18.900 --> 14:21.111
We'll see how long
you can keep this whole thing going.

14:21.736 --> 14:24.072
RAN-I'S COMMENT
PROVOKED YOON'S WILDER NATURE

14:24.155 --> 14:25.156
Hold on.

14:26.074 --> 14:27.909
I don't leave debts unpaid.

14:28.994 --> 14:30.287
[Deul-i] No!

14:30.370 --> 14:32.163
No! Don't do it!

14:33.832 --> 14:35.458
YOON BID HER FAREWELL

14:35.542 --> 14:39.838
IT WAS FOR SI-ON, OF ALL PEOPLE

14:45.051 --> 14:46.970
[sighs]

14:47.053 --> 14:50.223
CHAPTER 33:
SOMETHING UTTERLY USELESS

14:51.308 --> 14:52.767
-[Woo-su] Eun Ha-su.
-Here.

14:53.643 --> 14:54.894
-[Woo-su] Oh A-rin.
-Here.

14:55.604 --> 14:56.771
-[Woo-su] Choi Yu-mi.
-Here.

14:57.856 --> 14:59.441
-[Woo-su] Yeo Eui-ju.
-Here.

15:00.025 --> 15:02.068
-Choi Go-ya.
-Here.

15:02.152 --> 15:03.320
Choi Ji-a.

15:07.449 --> 15:08.617
-Hong Su-min.
-Here.

15:08.700 --> 15:10.660
-[Woo-su] Jeon Chae-won.
-Here.

15:10.744 --> 15:12.537
-[Woo-su] Im Su-yeon.
-Here.

15:22.047 --> 15:23.423
-Im Su-yeon.
-Here.

15:23.506 --> 15:25.175
-[Woo-su] Lee Eun-ji.
-Here.

15:25.258 --> 15:26.509
-[Woo-su] Choi Hye-jeong.
-Here.

15:28.428 --> 15:29.596
Are you ready for today's class?

15:29.679 --> 15:31.806
[students murmuring]

15:31.890 --> 15:33.683
Why does it smell like alcohol?

15:33.767 --> 15:34.768
Do you smell that?

15:34.851 --> 15:36.227
-[tense music playing]
-It smells so nasty.

15:36.311 --> 15:37.562
It kinda smells like alcohol.

15:42.942 --> 15:44.944
-[pounds]
-Quiet down.

15:48.365 --> 15:49.407
Who is on cleaning duty?

15:50.283 --> 15:51.451
[Eui-ju] M-Me.

15:52.994 --> 15:54.329
-Yeo Eui-ju.
-Yes?

15:54.913 --> 15:56.748
-Do it again.
-Sure.

15:56.831 --> 15:58.958
Let some air in. Open the windows.

15:59.042 --> 16:01.127
-[students murmuring]
-[student grunts] It's cold.

16:01.211 --> 16:02.504
Why? Is he for real?

16:03.296 --> 16:04.964
Choi Ji-a, go see the nurse.

16:05.840 --> 16:08.843
[students whispering]

16:24.025 --> 16:25.193
-Hi.
-Hello.

16:26.236 --> 16:27.696
[sniffing]

16:31.783 --> 16:32.784
Hey!

16:43.628 --> 16:44.963
Mr. Ga Woo-su.

16:45.046 --> 16:47.006
She's your student, right?

16:47.090 --> 16:50.218
Are you aware that
she came to school completely drunk?

16:50.301 --> 16:52.679
[Young-hee] Outrageous!
Totally outrageous.

16:52.762 --> 16:56.433
How could a student come to school
reeking of alcohol like this, huh?

16:58.059 --> 16:59.185
[retches]

16:59.269 --> 17:00.895
[E-den, Young-hee scoff]

17:01.604 --> 17:03.940
Aren't you the one
who didn't wear a school uniform

17:04.023 --> 17:05.358
during the EBC production?

17:05.442 --> 17:08.570
Do you even plan
to keep going to school at all, dear?

17:08.653 --> 17:09.696
Please, Ms. Kim.

17:10.447 --> 17:13.616
Let me talk to her and find out exactly
what happened, and I'll get back to you.

17:14.743 --> 17:15.910
Mr. Ga Woo-su.

17:15.994 --> 17:20.749
Is there any reason whatsoever
I should tolerate underage drinking here?

17:23.960 --> 17:25.128
Wait outside.

17:30.467 --> 17:32.510
-[tuts]
-[door closes]

17:32.594 --> 17:35.388
I don't wanna argue
over something trivial.

17:35.472 --> 17:36.765
[groans]

17:36.848 --> 17:38.266
I got a massage yesterday.

17:38.349 --> 17:39.851
-[E-den] Aw…
-My shoulders are stiff again.

17:39.934 --> 17:40.935
[groans]

17:41.519 --> 17:45.356
Choi Ji-a has different circumstances
from those of other students.

17:45.440 --> 17:48.109
Without parental care,
she lives in a foster shelter,

17:48.193 --> 17:49.652
working to support herself.

17:49.736 --> 17:53.281
Even after all that, she's still willing
to come to school almost every day.

17:53.364 --> 17:55.241
Oh, really?

17:55.325 --> 17:56.659
That's great.

17:56.743 --> 17:59.662
She'll be able to manage
at another school then. Hmm?

17:59.746 --> 18:02.081
She might look tough
but she's still just a kid.

18:04.250 --> 18:06.920
As her homeroom teacher,
I'll take responsibility

18:07.504 --> 18:09.839
and I'll make sure
you see real change in Choi Ji-a.

18:10.882 --> 18:12.091
Please just give her chance.

18:12.175 --> 18:13.468
Mr. Ga Woo-su.

18:13.551 --> 18:15.470
Do you know what our school motto is?

18:16.221 --> 18:19.140
Be an Elite! That's what it is.

18:19.849 --> 18:23.353
No matter how you look at it, whatever
that student plans to do with her life…

18:23.436 --> 18:25.313
[sighs] …it's a far cry from that.

18:25.980 --> 18:27.857
And no matter how much I think of it,

18:28.358 --> 18:32.028
she just doesn't belong
at Murim Girls' High School. That's all.

18:32.111 --> 18:34.155
You may go now.

18:35.156 --> 18:36.658
[sighs]

18:42.664 --> 18:44.165
-[door closes]
-[E-den scoffs]

18:44.249 --> 18:47.001
Who does he think he is,
taking the wrong side?

18:47.085 --> 18:50.547
How could he possibly stand up for a kid
who came to school drunk?

18:50.630 --> 18:52.257
[scoffs] So annoying.

18:53.424 --> 18:56.135
Would you believe
he's friends with the Na Deul-i?

18:56.219 --> 18:57.720
Who's Na Deul-i?

18:57.804 --> 18:59.973
Auntie, really? You're kidding.

19:00.056 --> 19:01.933
She's the professor
who won the Fields Medal.

19:02.016 --> 19:03.226
They're friends.

19:03.977 --> 19:05.019
What?

19:05.520 --> 19:07.981
I can't believe what you're saying!

19:08.064 --> 19:10.066
Why are you telling me this now?

19:10.149 --> 19:11.776
When was I supposed to tell you?

19:12.402 --> 19:13.653
-[scoffs]
-[Young-hee exclaims]

19:17.907 --> 19:18.908
Choi Ji-a.

19:22.829 --> 19:24.247
Why did you…

19:26.082 --> 19:28.334
It's wrong for a student
to show up drunk at school.

19:31.337 --> 19:33.840
What matters here is
what you choose to do next.

19:33.923 --> 19:37.135
Write a detailed paper self-reflecting
on what exactly you did wrong

19:37.218 --> 19:38.761
and how you're going to change.

19:38.845 --> 19:40.680
I'm going to hand it to the principal.

19:42.140 --> 19:43.766
Okay.

19:43.850 --> 19:47.186
I'll try to reduce the penalty, so
don't forget to wear your school uniform.

19:48.313 --> 19:50.231
And no more absences.

19:50.315 --> 19:51.816
Okay.

19:57.322 --> 19:59.198
-[Yeong-jae] This is the best.
-[Dan-ji] What on earth is this?

19:59.282 --> 20:00.992
-Hey, Eui-ju. Over here. Come on.
-Eui-ju, come!

20:01.075 --> 20:02.702
-Hurry. Over here.
-That was so cool.

20:02.785 --> 20:05.079
-Whoa, this is to die for.
-Try this.

20:05.163 --> 20:06.497
This lunch is so delicious.

20:06.581 --> 20:07.916
Go-ya, where are you going?

20:09.626 --> 20:10.710
Can I eat here with you?

20:12.295 --> 20:13.630
Eui-ju, sit down. Sit.

20:13.713 --> 20:14.839
[Dan-ji] Let's…

20:14.923 --> 20:16.424
[student] Here. Have some of my soup.

20:17.425 --> 20:20.386
[Yeong-jae] Oh. The meat is
so delicious today. Try this too.

20:20.470 --> 20:22.263
Eat up, Eui-ju. It's so good.

20:26.100 --> 20:28.144
Go-ya, can I talk to you for a sec…

20:28.227 --> 20:29.729
[student] I don't know.
I left them in my locker.

20:29.812 --> 20:31.689
[student 2] Yeah. The exam is coming soon.

20:32.398 --> 20:33.399
Where are you going? Huh?

20:33.483 --> 20:34.692
No, I get it.

20:34.776 --> 20:36.903
-Guys, guys I have crazy news.
-What is it?

20:36.986 --> 20:39.280
Guess what.
Young-hee was going to transfer Ji-a.

20:39.364 --> 20:41.074
But Mr. Ga stopped her.

20:41.658 --> 20:42.659
-Really?
-No way.

20:42.742 --> 20:44.035
She's on probation.

20:44.911 --> 20:48.164
Hmm. I wonder what kind of card he played.

20:48.831 --> 20:49.916
I bet there's something.

20:51.960 --> 20:54.337
Anyway, when are you going
to make up with Go-ya?

20:54.420 --> 20:57.298
You keep making me
tell the same story twice. [smacks lips]

20:57.382 --> 20:58.383
What a mess, huh?

20:58.466 --> 20:59.717
Um…

20:59.801 --> 21:02.762
Does she still refuse to talk to you?

21:03.846 --> 21:04.847
Mm-hmm.

21:05.348 --> 21:08.810
Well then what did you guys fight about?

21:11.729 --> 21:12.855
We didn't.

21:12.939 --> 21:14.649
W-We didn't fight.

21:15.608 --> 21:16.734
-[Dan-ji] What is it?
-[Yeong-jae] As if.

21:16.818 --> 21:18.903
-[Dan-ji] Come on. Tell us.
-I don't believe you.

21:20.279 --> 21:22.615
[crickets chirping]

21:27.787 --> 21:29.998
[Deul-i] I'm looking to do
some joint research with you.

21:30.081 --> 21:31.874
[gentle music playing]

21:33.042 --> 21:35.628
It's been really nice talking to you.

21:37.005 --> 21:38.131
[chuckles]

21:38.214 --> 21:39.757
I'm not sure how long it will take

21:39.841 --> 21:41.801
but I'd really like to study it with you.

21:42.468 --> 21:44.887
The topology of algebraic curves
and surfaces.

21:48.850 --> 21:49.851
Why that topic?

21:51.310 --> 21:53.813
I don't know. I was just drawn to it.

21:54.313 --> 21:56.566
When looking for something that
is never useful.

21:59.944 --> 22:04.157
It reminded me of a quote
by the British mathematician Hardy.

22:04.240 --> 22:06.576
"None of my discoveries has made,

22:06.659 --> 22:08.202
or is likely to make,

22:08.286 --> 22:10.913
any difference
to the comfort of the world,

22:10.997 --> 22:12.874
directly or indirectly.

22:12.957 --> 22:14.667
-For better or worse…
-"…or worse,

22:14.751 --> 22:17.086
[both] I have never done anything useful."

22:19.505 --> 22:21.716
[both chuckle]

22:22.425 --> 22:23.843
I want to try that.

22:24.510 --> 22:26.512
Accomplishing something utterly useless.

22:32.643 --> 22:33.644
[sighs]

22:43.696 --> 22:44.947
Where are you going?

22:45.031 --> 22:46.365
For a walk.

22:46.449 --> 22:48.785
I'll come with.
I need to go for a walk too.

22:51.412 --> 22:52.955
Are you still getting headaches?

22:53.039 --> 22:54.040
Sometimes.

22:54.624 --> 22:56.084
Shouldn't you see the doctor?

22:56.167 --> 22:57.210
It's not that bad.

22:57.877 --> 22:59.629
[Dong-ju] Still, go for a checkup.

22:59.712 --> 23:01.380
It's better to be safe than sorry.

23:01.923 --> 23:02.924
[Woo-su] Okay.

23:03.466 --> 23:05.093
[Dong-ju] Don't just say it, though.

23:05.176 --> 23:06.177
Make sure you go.

23:07.303 --> 23:08.304
[Woo-su] Okay.

23:10.890 --> 23:11.891
[sighs]

23:13.392 --> 23:15.812
[smacks lips, sighs]

23:15.895 --> 23:16.896
[laptop chimes]

23:19.982 --> 23:21.150
I need a soda.

23:22.401 --> 23:23.778
[sighs]

23:23.861 --> 23:26.739
But I'm already home!

23:27.949 --> 23:30.118
-[sighs]
-[typing]

23:30.201 --> 23:31.619
I'm in my room already.

23:31.702 --> 23:33.162
Can't you wait until tomorrow?

23:35.248 --> 23:37.875
Mom! I have something to tell you.

23:37.959 --> 23:39.377
Hey, hey, hey, Eui-do.

23:39.460 --> 23:41.087
Okay, fine. [laughs] Okay, fine.

23:41.170 --> 23:42.171
I'll go, I'll go.

23:42.255 --> 23:43.464
[sighs]

23:43.548 --> 23:45.550
[pop music playing on speakers]

24:02.984 --> 24:04.735
What do you think
about your friend's offer?

24:05.486 --> 24:06.487
Na Deul-i's?

24:07.238 --> 24:08.239
Honestly.

24:08.739 --> 24:10.575
Not interested at all.

24:11.409 --> 24:12.410
That's a lie.

24:13.327 --> 24:16.038
You answered that way too fast.
Like it was planned.

24:17.874 --> 24:21.586
You know, I want you to spend your time
on something that you really want to do.

24:22.879 --> 24:25.089
So when you have a chance,
go to the States.

24:25.173 --> 24:26.465
And do the research you want

24:27.341 --> 24:28.342
before it's too late.

24:29.719 --> 24:31.470
[Eui-ju] You're going to the States,
Mr. Ga?

24:34.557 --> 24:37.768
[somber music playing]

25:08.883 --> 25:11.219
-[Woo-su] It's late. Go home.
-No.

25:11.302 --> 25:13.179
The truth is, I…

25:13.262 --> 25:15.097
[Woo-su] Didn't I tell you
to stay away from her?

25:15.181 --> 25:16.891
[Dong-ju groans] Now what?

25:16.974 --> 25:19.310
-[Woo-su] How did you get here?
-[Eui-ju] Mr. Ga. What do I do?

25:19.393 --> 25:22.438
[grunts] Why wouldn't she pick up?
Why is she not even checking her phone?

25:22.521 --> 25:24.732
-[Ji-a] Get out of here.
-[gasps] Mr. Ga!

25:24.815 --> 25:26.609
[Woo-su] I guess
you guys haven't figured me out yet.

25:26.692 --> 25:28.903
[Eui-ju] You'll be dead meat
for real, then.

25:28.986 --> 25:31.280
Dang. He's so cool.

25:31.364 --> 25:32.907
So cool.

25:32.990 --> 25:34.158
[Go-ya] Just tell him.

25:34.242 --> 25:36.619
You have to look into his eyes
to show you mean it.

25:36.702 --> 25:38.371
-I…
-[Go-ya] Make eye contact.

25:38.454 --> 25:39.997
For at least three seconds.
